<title>UK: EBRD adds 25 bln lire to 10-year structured bond.</title>
<headline>EBRD adds 25 bln lire to 10-year structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 225 billion lire from 200 billion lire, joint lead managers Banca di Roma and Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    225 BLN ITL   COUPON    *10 PCT    MATURITY   *27.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  98.875    PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    97.25     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   1.625</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE 27.MAR.00 AT PAR, WHEN COUPON CHANGES TO</p>
<p>		19.5 PCT MINUS TWO TIMES 6M LIBOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
